    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear Zhian,</div><div><br></div><div>I would like use aboot with a genclone object (12 SSR loci, ploidy=4, using bruvo.dist), on the contracted MLGs.<br></div><div><br></div><div>I get this error message:</div><div><br></div><div><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\" lang=\"DE\">ab&lt;-aboot(E,dist=bruvo.dist,replen=E.reps)</span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\">Error in (function\r\n(classes, fdef, mtable)<span>  </span>: </span></p>\r\n\r\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><span>  </span>unable to find an inherited method for\r\nfunction ‘ploidy’ for signature ‘&quot;bootgen&quot;’</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"><br></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Could you please give me a hint, what to do?</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thanks</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Walter</p><br><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Courier New&quot;\"></span></p>\r\n\r\n<pre style=\"font-family:&#39;Lucida Console&#39;;font-size:10pt!important;outline:none;border:none;word-break:break-all;margin:0px;white-space:pre-wrap!important;line-height:11.538461685180664px;color:rgb(230,225,220);font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;text-align:-webkit-left;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(22,22,22)\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0)\"><span style=\"background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><span></span><span></span></span></span><span><span style=\"color:rgb(253,194,81)\"></span></span></pre></div></div>"
